                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "75c341a8-f89d-3589-bf52-429c6505d406",
                        "entry_id": "73bfa44b-3802-31d0-99b5-a8211b550b9d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Verfechterin des Agnostizismus"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40c90a73-4c66-4c80-a60b-047b416bfce3",
                                "sense_id": "75c341a8-f89d-3589-bf52-429c6505d406",
                                "text": "„Ausgerechnet die Agnostikerin Bruner soll nun eine Legitimation für den tödlichen Exorzismus liefern.“ (www.spiegel.de)"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c59e2e2-80b1-4fa5-8279-016c075c8530",
                        "source_entry_id": "73bfa44b-3802-31d0-99b5-a8211b550b9d",
                        "source_sense_id": "75c341a8-f89d-3589-bf52-429c6505d406",
                        "source_sense_description": "Verfechterin des Agnostizismus",
                        "target_lang_word": "agnostic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agnostic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa05943e-7485-3713-bd90-512ee11cea07",
                                        "entry_id": "59404a62-92b3-34c6-aa15-fb6889784c89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doubtful or uncertain about the existence or demonstrability of God or other deity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26411019-de37-472f-9c42-4a63eac2b666",
                                                "sense_id": "aa05943e-7485-3713-bd90-512ee11cea07",
                                                "text": "She left the church when she had become agnostic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7e814be-7fd7-3896-aa58-5d6733d74caf",
                                        "entry_id": "59404a62-92b3-34c6-aa15-fb6889784c89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no firmly held opinions on something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82d1bd0a-4ff9-429a-99f2-9316b531cd4d",
                                                "sense_id": "c7e814be-7fd7-3896-aa58-5d6733d74caf",
                                                "text": "I'm agnostic on whether ethanol is a green fuel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aac9e9a3-51e8-4c43-a4cc-f55dc4ed0d63",
                                                "sense_id": "c7e814be-7fd7-3896-aa58-5d6733d74caf",
                                                "text": "He says he's agnostic concerning the Secretary's claims."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f1cd480-d8db-332e-bc8b-0ee9c6411464",
                                        "entry_id": "59404a62-92b3-34c6-aa15-fb6889784c89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to agnosticism or its adherents."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fcd568e-a38c-416a-87c6-4861c78f8c2d",
                                                "sense_id": "6f1cd480-d8db-332e-bc8b-0ee9c6411464",
                                                "text": "His agnostic viewpoint is summarized in his book."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a6de1d3-a3f9-474e-a43b-0d1e69dc26ef",
                                                "sense_id": "6f1cd480-d8db-332e-bc8b-0ee9c6411464",
                                                "text": "In matters of the intellect do not pretend that conclusions are certain which are not demonstrated or demonstrable. That I take to be the agnostic faith, which if a man keep whole and undefiled, he shall not be ashamed to look the universe in the face, whatever the future may have in store for him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eabd3c78-eb3f-3b81-ab30-b7e54c6cf2bd",
                                        "entry_id": "59404a62-92b3-34c6-aa15-fb6889784c89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unaware or noncommittal regarding the specific nature of the components or input with which it interacts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a software component etc."
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "401d5599-a433-4221-aee6-cceb789eccc3",
                                                "sense_id": "eabd3c78-eb3f-3b81-ab30-b7e54c6cf2bd",
                                                "text": "The socket communications layer is agnostic with regard to its underlying transport mechanism—it is “transport-agnostic”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5051f14d-6056-41a1-8ff1-f30586462829",
                                                "sense_id": "eabd3c78-eb3f-3b81-ab30-b7e54c6cf2bd",
                                                "text": "The software's registration key is platform agnostic and will work on both x86 and ARM processors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "agnostic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83a45564-386f-3f35-bcd8-63591f96a985",
                                        "entry_id": "a9089963-7332-3e2b-aed9-58483f597018",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who holds to a form of agnosticism, especially uncertainty of the existence of a deity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d58fe11-e55a-468c-b3ea-62f507177587",
                                                "sense_id": "83a45564-386f-3f35-bcd8-63591f96a985",
                                                "text": "The Agnostic is one who asserts—what no one denies—that there are limits to the sphere of human intelligence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87be8d72-3f76-41e9-99d0-979fa17a439a",
                                                "sense_id": "83a45564-386f-3f35-bcd8-63591f96a985",
                                                "text": "An agnostic thinks it impossible to know the truth in matters such as God and the future life with which Christianity and other religions are concerned."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74548792-ad2e-428e-8ac8-fab1c60e150c",
                                                "sense_id": "83a45564-386f-3f35-bcd8-63591f96a985",
                                                "text": "When I say I'm an agnostic, I only mean that the evidence isn't in. There isn't compelling evidence that God exists — at least your kind of god — and there isn't compelling evidence that he doesn't."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5838b0d-20df-4ca9-8624-6fe07c8041e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "73bfa44b-3802-31d0-99b5-a8211b550b9d",
                        "source_sense_id": "75c341a8-f89d-3589-bf52-429c6505d406",
                        "source_sense_description": "Verfechterin des Agnostizismus",
                        "target_lang_word": "agnostique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agnostique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae2db1ad-2ca3-319f-9818-19094009460b",
                                        "entry_id": "d668f1ac-1a59-34b9-af9a-b3e025e69d3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui pense que Dieu est inconnaissable, qui ne prétend pas connaître les secrets de l’Univers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c70b0632-b098-4e12-9193-49ac0e5036f6",
                                                "sense_id": "ae2db1ad-2ca3-319f-9818-19094009460b",
                                                "text": "Sur cette question métaphysique, Jung reste agnostique : il ne sait pas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3823bc90-6572-4108-bd32-ff32a56eec01",
                                                "sense_id": "ae2db1ad-2ca3-319f-9818-19094009460b",
                                                "text": "Un mystique ne peut être qu’agnostique. Il tend vers mais n’aboutit pas. S’il aboutissait, il serait Dieu lui-même et alors, ce ne serait plus de la mystique, mais de la folie paranoïaque."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b407a253-dac6-40f5-9ddd-83e411fa41be",
                                                "sense_id": "ae2db1ad-2ca3-319f-9818-19094009460b",
                                                "text": "Le penseur tunisien Fadhel Ben Achour (1909-1970) dit qu’il y a dans les sociétés musulmanes une « orthodoxie » de masse, diffuse, mais extrêmement coercitive. A cause de cette pression sociale, se dire agnostique ou athée est impossible à assumer, et cela même pour les consciences émancipées."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc7987ec-4faa-3bd1-88db-5c3aea2480bc",
                                        "entry_id": "d668f1ac-1a59-34b9-af9a-b3e025e69d3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui peut s’adapter aux composants avec lesquels il interagit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47025dc6-741b-4404-8772-328f51b4e2f0",
                                                "sense_id": "dc7987ec-4faa-3bd1-88db-5c3aea2480bc",
                                                "text": "Le « socket » (lien, connexion) de la couche de communication est agnostique en ce qui concerne les mécanismes de transports sous-jacents – il est « transport-agnostique »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d861a26-4b99-3c1d-a417-d1e75bfdace9",
                                        "entry_id": "d668f1ac-1a59-34b9-af9a-b3e025e69d3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit de recherches scientifiques sans présupposé, sans faire référence à ce qui est déjà connu, ou existe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6abc7c46-67a4-4a2f-bc7e-a72f47c6174c",
                                                "sense_id": "9d861a26-4b99-3c1d-a417-d1e75bfdace9",
                                                "text": "Cette exploration oblige la communauté scientifique à se pencher sur les questions de l'identification et de la définition des concepts de biosignatures absolues, de biosignatures universelles et de biosignatures agnostiques, tout en avançant sur les méthodes pour les reconnaître à distance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "agnostique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e7b5495-e357-3c98-a46b-fa473a6e7c3f",
                                        "entry_id": "bace9a59-98c2-3a34-9d74-40cbd11d7f14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui pense que Dieu est inconnaissable, qui ne prétend pas connaître les secrets de l’Univers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06f3b28d-730c-49d3-966d-6228f15901b7",
                                                "sense_id": "5e7b5495-e357-3c98-a46b-fa473a6e7c3f",
                                                "text": "\"L’agnostique ni ne croit ni ne croit pas : il doute, il s’interroge, il hésite, ou bien il refuse de choisir. Il coche la case \"sans opinion\" du grand sondage métaphysique \"croyez-vous en Dieu ?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
